        {
            "+content": "Nighthawk was a hitman who left even the most evil of men shaking in their boots at just the mention of their name. But it's been eight years since the last hunt, and Nighthawk remains in the shadows. Well, not exactly the shadows. Nighthawk is now retired, living on her own in a pigsty apartment, spending every last bit of money on gambling and gacha games. She's far from the fearsome figure she used to be and is more of a NEET than a stone-cold killer. But with eviction on the horizon and barely any yen left, Nighthawk will have to make her return.",
